<title>USA: US March S&amp;P 500 turns up, erasing massive slide.</title>
<headline>US March S&amp;P 500 turns up, erasing massive slide.</headline>
<text>
<p>Jan 2 - U.S. March S&amp;P 500 futures turned into positive territory, erasing the massive early losses tied to strong NAPM. Traders said market volume had picked up from early post-selloff lethargy, but said overall trade was still only light to moderate. Support now at 740.00 and 744.00.</p>
<p>((DerivativesDesk(312)408-8750/E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
